  Description: "COMPANION / COMMON / 1 STAR\r\nTALENT\nHero maximum HP +5 and armor
    +0.08 per talent. These are hero-only bonuses, not extra health for immortal
    companions.\r\n\nSUPPORT WHILE OWNED\nTeam / Flat melee damage: +1\nChampion
    / Maximum health: -1\nTier 1/2/3 traits \xD71/2/4; merging three units reduces
    support sources.\n\r\n\nLIFE IN THE WAITING REALM\nRaised beneath the market,
    they whistle to navigate steam vents. An answering voice once brought their family
    into danger. They learned that an answer is not necessarily an invitation, and
    now check every route before guiding anyone.\r\nPERSONAL PASSIVE\nEvery 4s in
    combat, gain 0 gold directly. This is not kill loot and does not count as collecting
    a coin.\r\n\nNamed talents count bodies and absorbed memories; their stated percentages
    are not multiplied by star level unless explicitly stated. Listed support modifiers
    scale separately at 1/2/4.\r\nBonds: hearth, archer, hide. Immortal. Weapon rolls
    on recruitment; two equal-species/equal-star bodies merge unless the talent
    forbids it."
